# Everything is excluded, and the package is named file by file below.
#
# This was a list of things to leave out, which means anything not on it ships. A stray
# `Support/Code/argv.json` — written by a mistyped path, holding a proposed-API flag for a
# feature that no longer exists — was published into the package that way, and nothing failed.
# What goes in a package that reaches other people's machines is worth stating outright.
**

!package.json
!README.md
!LICENSE
!CHANGELOG.md

# The extension itself: one bundled file, its stylesheets, its icons.
!dist/extension.js
!media/cards.js
!media/cards.css
!media/codicon.css
!media/codicon.ttf
!resources/icon.png
!resources/icon.svg

# The Claude Code plugin, which `redline.setUpHook` installs from inside the extension.
!.claude-plugin/marketplace.json
!plugin/.claude-plugin/plugin.json
!plugin/hooks/hooks.json
!plugin/hooks/redline-touched.mjs
!plugin/hooks/redline-touched.sh
